          "value": "<p>Using the surrounding metal, <span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ad8eebde-7fff-3046-4a8a-89c2b809fdc8\">the fallen noble turns a @Template[type:burst|distance:15] within 60 feet into difficult terrain for 1 minute (including the air). Creatures in the area take @Damage[(4d6)[electricity]] with a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:21|basic:true]. </span></p>\n<p>On a critical failure, the creature is either knocked @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}, or pulled up to 10 feet in a direction chosen by the fallen noble (15 feet if they're wearing metal armor).</p>\n<p>It can't use Greater Polarized Terrain again for [[/br 1d4 #Recharge Greater Polarized Terrain]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-ad8eebde-7fff-3046-4a8a-89c2b809fdc8\"></span></p>"
